{"unit_id":"my-dsh__dsh-mcp-status#card-zh","repo":"my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status","commit":"15932527c0bbbcfbb4289a828e0e9bde2d314aaf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status 是 DSH Web 插件，在消息输入框工具栏提供 MCP 连接面板。它读取配置的 MCP server 行，展示连接阶段、目标位置和已注册工具数，并通过开关按需挂载或卸载 MCP client；读取列表本身不会改变连接。可用于只在需要时启动常用配置之外的 MCP 服务，并查看本次运行的连接状态。插件重启后由面板管理的连接不会保留；需要 DSH Web profile 和已有 MCP server 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:395-433","client.js:643-650","index.js:303-333","index.js:344-380"]}
{"unit_id":"my-dsh__dsh-mcp-status#card-en","repo":"my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status","commit":"15932527c0bbbcfbb4289a828e0e9bde2d314aaf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status adds an MCP panel to the DSH Web toolbar. It lists configured servers, connection states and tool counts, and lets users connect or disconnect servers on demand. Status reads do not alter connections; panel-managed connections last for this run. Requires configured MCP rows.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:395-433","client.js:643-650","index.js:303-333","index.js:344-380"]}
