{"unit_id":"my-dsh__dsh-mcp-status#feature-1","repo":"my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status","commit":"15932527c0bbbcfbb4289a828e0e9bde2d314aaf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status 的功能「查看 MCP 状态」：工具栏面板列出配置的服务器、目标和连接阶段，并显示每个服务器注册的工具数。打开或刷新列表只读取状态，不会发起连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:303-333","client.js:307-313"]}
{"unit_id":"my-dsh__dsh-mcp-status#feature-2","repo":"my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status","commit":"15932527c0bbbcfbb4289a828e0e9bde2d314aaf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status 的功能「按需连接和断开」：用户切换服务器开关时，插件挂载对应 MCP client 或释放挂载。连接结果会区分已连接、连接中和失败等状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:203-243","index.js:344-380"]}
{"unit_id":"my-dsh__dsh-mcp-status#feature-3","repo":"my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status","commit":"15932527c0bbbcfbb4289a828e0e9bde2d314aaf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status 的功能「连接等待上限」：连接操作默认最多等待 8000 毫秒后向面板报告仍在连接；可选 connectTimeoutMs 配置限制在 0 到 120000 毫秒。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:55-58","index.js:76-82","index.js:229-233"]}
{"unit_id":"my-dsh__dsh-mcp-status#feature-4","repo":"my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status","commit":"15932527c0bbbcfbb4289a828e0e9bde2d314aaf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status 的功能「兼容启用中的配置行」：如果 profile 中某个 MCP 行仍启用，关闭面板开关会经 Plugin Manager 将该行设为禁用；面板自己打开的连接则只在本次运行中管理。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:246-267","index.js:344-370"]}
{"unit_id":"my-dsh__dsh-mcp-status#caveat-1","repo":"my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status","commit":"15932527c0bbbcfbb4289a828e0e9bde2d314aaf","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status 使用前须知：现有 MCP 行需禁用才能避免启动时连接；关闭仍启用的行会将禁用状态写回 profile。（见 index.js:363-366）","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:14-20","index.js:363-366"]}
